# verifier mutants of web/src/sink/presentation.js (line numbers as of 2356edbd1), applied one at a
# time to a scratch copy of web/src/sink and run against the acceptance test files. The repo file
# was not edited for these. KILLED = at least one test fails; SURVIVED = all tests pass.
#
#   M1  delete line 363                         (_deliver never clears pending damage)
#   M2  delete lines 349-350                    (no size check: always union with pending damage)
#   M3  delete line 350                         (size check ignores the height)
#   M9  delete line 349                         (size check ignores the width)
#   M4  delete line 515                         (invalidate keeps pending damage)
#   M5  line 363 without `if (!replay)`         (a replay clears pending damage as well)
#   M6  line 503 -> `const immediate = checked; this._pendingDamage = null;`
#   M7  line 351 -> `rect: pending.rect`        (keeps only the older rect)
#   M8  line 354 -> `rect: checked.rect`        (pending damage records the newest rect, not the union)

